Changelog: 18-11-2026 03:13:06

Added. RPCN, RPCS3's online service, as shadPS4 Manager has shadNet: an RPCN Account pill opens a window that
creates an account on an RPCN server, tries a sign-in, has the token mailed again and saves the account in RPCS3's
own files, so RPCS3 signs in when a game starts. An RPCN line names the account that signs in, and beside the app's
state stands RPCN Off, Online or Offline. The password is kept and sent as RPCS3 derives it, never as typed.

Changelog: 18-11-2026 02:32:46

Added. The managers' new design, as PPSSPP Manager's and PCSX2 Manager's: a Memory cards tab with the saves on
RPCS3's hard disk (export to a .zip, import, delete). Clear logs, a tab beside Log that is a button, empties the
app's log file and the Log tab and removes the older log files. Start game stands beside Your games. The six tabs
share the window's whole width and are pills as the ones above them. Play time moved from the header to the row
of action pills. Under the header's pills only the links to RPCS3's release notes and the wiki are left, in the
type of a pill's caption; the introduction went. RPCS3's state is one line, and the Firmware line is the version alone, or Uninstalled. Under the games an info symbol stands
in for the line of text about Steam. The window opens 900 wide (it was 980), which is its narrowest, and 606 high
(it was 800); the Settings tab scrolls when it is higher than the window.

